{'symbol': 'DAL', 'date': '2019-10-08 22:30:00', 'title': 'DELTA AIR LINES WAIVES CHANGE FEES FOR JAPAN AHEAD OF TYPHOON HAGIBI', 'text': 'OCT 9  - DELTA AIR LINES INC <DAL.N>::DELTA AIR LINES INC - WAIVES CHANGE FEES FOR JAPAN AHEAD OF TYPHOON HAGIBI.DELTA AIR LINES - ISSUED WEATHER WAIVER FOR 4 JAPANESE CITIES ALLOWING CUSTOMERS TO MAKE 1-TIME CHANGE TO THEIR ITINERARY WITHOUT CHANGE FEE.DELTA AIR LINES INC - ISSUED A WEATHER WAIVER FOR KANSAI (KIX), NAGOYA (NGO), TOKYO-HANEDA (HND) AND TOKYO-NARITA (NRT)  AHEAD OF TYPHOON HAGIBI.'}